new file mode 100644
index 0000000..0060a9f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/CAPTAIN.md
@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@
+> STOP. Captain's notes: non-binding. Captain writes, Captain trims. Anyone else: close this file now.
+
+# Captain Notes
+
+## Intent
+
+Build a Vanilla JS TodoMVC app per `assets/app-spec.md` using `assets/app-template.index.html`. Persist to localStorage. No preprocessors.
+
+## Decisions
+
+- Stack: Vanilla JavaScript per the spec (no framework). Node.js runtime via RIGGING.md.
+- Dependencies: `todomvc-common` and `todomvc-app-css` installed as npm deps, per the template spec.
+- Route pattern: hash-based routing (#/, #/active, #/completed), vanilla implementation.
+- localStorage key: `todos-vanillajs` per the spec's naming convention.
+
+## Next
+
+1. Watchbill dispatched to QM with target scenarios.
+2. QM produces step definitions + verification support.
+3. Shipwright produces `js/app.js`, `css/app.css`, final `index.html`.
+4. Boatswain custody outbound.
+
+## Open Questions
+
+None.
\ No newline at end of file
